  "name": "html-diff",
  "description": "Prove that a refactor changes no rendered HTML, using the `html-diff` harness over every preview page. Use before and after any change that is meant to be output-neutral — extracting or renaming a component, replacing hand-written markup with a `shared/ui` component, reordering props, restructuring a layout, migrating SCSS class emission — and whenever the user asks whether a change is safe or byte-identical. Covers capturing the baseline, reading the diff, and what counts as an acceptable difference.",
